|date=December 29, 2011
|author=Keith Jackson
|title=SPL: Celtic 1 Rangers 0
|work=Daily Record
|url=http://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/football/spl/celtic/2011/12/29/spl-celtic-1-rangers-0-86908-23665738/
